{
  "id": "gid://shopify/Product/8949899984948",
  "title": "PAPA Premium Tattoo Cartridges",
  "handle": "papa-premium-tattoo-cartridges",
  "description": "PAPA Premium Tattoo Cartridges. Engineered with Japanese 316L Surgical Steel, micro-stabilized safety membrane, and optical-grade polycarbonate casing.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>PAPA Premium Tattoo Cartridge Needles</strong> are engineered specifically for high-end professional tattoo artists demanding utmost precision, needle stabilization, and hygienic safety.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Japanese 316L Surgical Stainless Steel</strong> needle pins with razor-sharp taper profiles.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Micro-Stabilized Poly-Elastomer Membrane</strong> system prevents ink spit-back and provides silent, zero-vibration needle guidance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optical-Grade Polycarbonate Casing</strong> ensures clear ink reservoir visibility and effortless fluid flow.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>100% EO Gas Sterilized</strong> in individual medical blister packs with sterile batch verification.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Universal Compatibility</strong> with all rotary cartridge machines and grips (Cheyenne, Bishop, FK Irons, Critical).</li>\n</ul>",
